yes(806,'A','The product side has two moles of gas for each mole of N₂O₄. Decreasing pressure by expansion at fixed temperature favours the side with more gas molecules, producing more NO₂.',[REB],question='For N₂O₄(g) ⇌ 2NO₂(g), which change at fixed temperature favours more product?',options=['A decrease in pressure by expansion','A decrease in volume','An increase in pressure by compression','Keeping volume constant'],check='equilibrium-gas-moles')
